{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-a27c91703f1a","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-a27c91703f1a","name":"美式炒蛋","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%8F%E7%82%92%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"4eb85b9785d575ca16ac8f3306ac60e989768f14","details":{"introduction":"这是一道松软鲜嫩的美式家常蛋料理，加入牛奶后蛋花细密、口感绵润，富含优质蛋白和钙质。做法简单，对新手友好，从准备到出锅大约只需 20 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋\n- 全脂牛奶/奶油\n- 黄油\n- 盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 鸡蛋 3 个\n- 全脂牛奶/奶油 10g\n- 黄油 5 克\n- 盐 1 克"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 鸡蛋打入大碗中，加盐搅打至起泡，静置 15 分钟\n2. 黄油切小块入锅，倒入蛋液，开小火不断搅拌\n3. 黄油一融化，就快速翻动蛋液，将其打碎成细密状，在蛋液大体凝固前关火\n4. 加入牛奶搅拌 15 秒，至炒蛋湿润绵密，装盘"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 想吃的更丰富可以在最后一步那里加上炒好的番茄丁，洋葱丁，培根丁，切好的芝士小丁，等等。(总之不会再出水的东东）\n- 使用平底锅（不粘锅）。\n- 考虑到很多人是一人食就炒一两个鸡蛋，口径比较小的锅或许更方便在锅中均匀搅拌。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：净全鸡蛋液200g、无盐黄油15g、3.25%全脂牛奶30g、食盐2g；整份约230g。无盐黄油、全脂奶标准，不加面包或其他配菜。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":179.065217,"protein_g":11.422826,"carbohydrate_g":1.253478,"fat_g":13.985217},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","version":"a7d909f4bae79db2","fdc_ids":[171287,173430,172217,173468]},"profile_id":"family-a27c91703f1a-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-a27c91703f1a","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-a27c91703f1a","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-a27c91703f1a-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg","grams":200},{"key":"butter","grams":15},{"key":"milk","grams":30},{"key":"salt","grams"